Build a complete retro arcade Snake game in HTML/CSS/JavaScript with neon aesthetic. The game runs in a single HTML file on a 480x480 canvas.

**Core Gameplay:**
- 20×20 grid with 24px cells
- Snake starts center-aligned with 3 segments facing right
- Arrow keys or WASD to control direction; support both simultaneously
- Input buffer holds up to 2 queued moves; prevent 180° turns and duplicate inputs
- Food spawns randomly in empty cells; collision adds 1 segment and scores 10 points
- Speed increases each food: start at 150ms per move, subtract 4ms per food (min 55ms)
- Death on wall collision or self-collision (tail is safe if growing that frame)

**Visual Style (Neon Arcade):**
- Dark background (#05050a); use "Press Start 2P" for chunky retro font
- Neon color palette: green (#39ff14), pink (#ff2ec4), cyan (#00f0ff), yellow (#ffee00)
- Canvas has glowing cyan border with box-shadow glow
- Faint cyan grid overlay on game field
- Snake head is cyan with glow, body segments fade to green with decreasing opacity
- Render chunky pixel eyes (4×4px) on the head, positioned by direction
- Food as pulsing pink diamond shape with glow (pulse cycle 180ms, scale 0.72–0.88)
- Partial canvas clearing creates neon motion trails: fill with 32% opacity dark color instead of full clear

**Effects & Feedback:**
- Particle burst on food eat: 14 pink/yellow particles radiating outward for ~450ms
- Screen shake on death: 420ms decay, random offset up to ±10px
- Death animation: 650ms flashing (80ms intervals) alternating red/white segments
- Audio: beeps on game start (660Hz, 880Hz), food eat (pitch rises with score), death (descending 220→140→80Hz sawtooth)

**Persistent State & UI:**
- localStorage high score under key 'neonSnakeHiScore'
- HUD above canvas: current score (green glow) on left, hi-score (pink glow) on right
- Start screen overlay with pulsing "NEON SNAKE" title (green + pink), "INSERT COIN" button (yellow, blinking), control hints
- Game Over overlay with final score, best score, "NEW HI-SCORE" badge (if applicable), "PRESS SPACE OR TAP" prompt
- CRT scanlines overlay across entire page (subtle 3px dark lines)

**Input & State:**
- Space or Enter to start from any screen or restart
- Three states: 'start', 'playing', 'dying' (650ms), 'gameover'
- Keyboard input from start state auto-starts game; any arrow/WASD key starts mid-start-screen
